 and Two Smoking Barrels","ratingNum":9.1,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 98% 剧情片\n好于 99% 喜剧片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p792443418.webp","tag":"No.67豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 英国","years":"1998","date":"1998-08-28(英国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2573318372.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2554608958.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2500515125.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2554609382.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p826057897.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p792443418.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2215069321.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2891398950.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2891398948.webp\"]","descs":"艾迪（尼克·莫伦）思维敏捷，是个玩牌高手。在三个好友的支持下，艾迪携巨资参加了黑社会的高额赌局，不想落入圈套，欠下50万的赌债。为了还清赌债，艾迪和朋友们绞尽脑汁，最终算计到一群毒贩身上，并为打劫购买了两杆老式烟枪。\n　　不想这群不安分的毒贩，正惦念着他们毒品供应商的钱，并在同一天实施了打劫。在毒贩们费尽周折，把毒品供应商熨的整整齐齐的钱款拿到手后，艾迪他们幸运的坐享其成。可是他们不知道，这看似简单的抢劫案背后，更有厉害的角色参与其中。他们手里的两杆破烟枪也隐藏着不少故事。\n　　在无知与莽撞中置身漩涡的他们能侥幸脱身么？笑料迭出的偶发事件里，穿插着小人物与大人物的辛酸幽默。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1rxMA3mxglchG7rCb50kk9w?pwd=776w\",\"size\":\"2.39\",\"date\":\"2025-07-09\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":79,"title":"我不是药神","ratingNum":9,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 98% 剧情片\n好于 99% 喜剧片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2561305376.webp","tag":"No.33豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 中国大陆","years":"2018","date":"2018-07-05(中国大陆)、2018-06-30(大规模点映)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2527182531.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2523632239.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2526120899.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2521723364.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2525589278.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2561305376.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2527119568.webp\"]","descs":"普通中年男子程勇（徐峥 饰）经营着一家保健品店，失意又失婚。不速之客吕受益（王传君 饰）的到来，让他开辟了一条去印度买药做“代购”的新事业，虽然困难重重，但他在这条“买药之路”上发现了商机，一发不可收拾地做起了治疗慢粒白血病的印度仿制药独家代理商。赚钱的同时，他也认识了几个病患及家属，为救女儿被迫做舞女的思慧（谭卓 饰）、说一口流利“神父腔”英语的刘牧师（杨新鸣 饰），以及脾气暴烈的“黄毛”（章宇 饰），几个人合伙做起了生意，利润倍增的同时也危机四伏。程勇昔日的小舅子曹警官（周一围 饰）奉命调查仿制药的源头，假药贩子张长林（王砚辉 饰）和瑞士正牌医药代表（李乃文 饰）也对其虎视眈眈，生意逐渐变成了一场关于救赎的拉锯战。\n　　本片改编自慢粒白血病患者陆勇代购抗癌药的真实事迹。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/19GBcVCQLucoBrvydM7zg8g?pwd=z3jc\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-08-19\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":895,"title":"安东尼娅家族 Antonia","ratingNum":9,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 84% 剧情片\n好于 93% 喜剧片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p544715774.webp","tag":"历届奥斯卡金像奖最佳外语片","address":" 荷兰 / 比利时 / 英国","years":"1995","date":"1995-09-12(多伦多电影节)、1995-09-20(荷兰)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2529746000.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2653300276.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2653300282.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2653300258.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2653300293.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p544715774.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2895309259.webp\"]","descs":"故事发生在二战结束之后，安东尼娅（维力奇·范·阿麦莱 Willeke van Ammelrooy 饰）带着女儿达尼埃莱（埃尔斯·多特曼斯 Els Dottermans 饰）回到了久违的家乡。安东尼娅乐善好施的善良性格为战后满目疮痍的家园带来的新的希望，她先后收留了痴呆女孩代代（玛丽娜·德·格拉夫 Marina de Graaf 饰）和农夫巴斯（简·德克莱尔 Jan Decleir 饰）等人，组件了一个特殊的家族——安东尼娅家族。\n　　一种温馨又紧密的关系维系着这些并没有血缘关系的家人们，在相互扶持之间，却也存在着难以调和的矛盾。达尼埃莱怀孕后生下了特雷莎（Veerle van Overloop 饰），小特雷莎长大后，却惨遭皮特（Filip Peeters 饰）的强暴。随着时间的流逝，安东尼娅家族不断的壮大着，而安东尼娅自己的生命却走向了尽头。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1bI0aFgVVbq6Y_lvyTFMxLg?pwd=m5ej\",\"size\":\"3.27\",\"date\":\"2025-06-30\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":1278,"title":"让子弹飞","ratingNum":9,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 98% 剧情片\n好于 99% 喜剧片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1512562287.webp","tag":"No.36豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 中国大陆 / 中国香港","years":"2010","date":"2010-12-16(中国大陆)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p458738612.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2581578348.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p458693958.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p458733229.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1512538354.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1512562287.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2205015699.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p760658636.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p760657847.webp\"]","descs":"民国年间，花钱捐得县长的马邦德（葛优 饰）携妻（刘嘉玲 饰）及随从走马上任。途经南国某地，遭劫匪张麻子（姜文 饰）一伙伏击，随从尽死，只夫妻二人侥幸活命。马为保命，谎称自己是县长的汤 师爷。为汤师爷许下的财富所动，张麻子摇身一变化身县长，带着手下赶赴鹅城上任。有道是天高皇帝远，鹅城地处偏僻，一方霸主黄四郎（周润发 饰）只手遮天，全然不将这个新来的县长放在眼里。张麻子痛打了黄的武教头（姜武 饰），黄则设计害死张的义子小六（张默 饰）。原本只想赚钱的马邦德，怎么也想不到竟会被卷入这场土匪和恶霸的角力之中。鹅城上空愁云密布，血雨腥风在所难免……\n　　本片根据马识途的小说《夜谭十记》中的《盗官记》一章改编。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1gm1UddwKjjsh4IzXBsQQwA?pwd=zrhp\",\"size\":\"2.52\",\"date\":\"2025-08-12\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":331,"title":"低俗小说 Pulp Fiction","ratingNum":8.9,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 98% 剧情片\n好于 99% 喜剧片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1910902213.webp","tag":"No.85豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 美国","years":"1994","date":"1994-05-12(戛纳电影节)、1994-10-14(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2567404101.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2577721736.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2580184715.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2580184717.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1568036330.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1910902213.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2166344286.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1365761917.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1766052460.webp\"]","descs":"《低俗小说》由“文森特和马沙的妻子”、“金表”、“邦妮的处境”三个故事以及影片首尾的序幕和尾声五个部分组成。看似独立的小故事里面，却又有环环相扣的人和事。\n　　盗贼“小南瓜”和“小兔子”在早餐店里打劫，却遇上了天大的麻烦——黑社会成员朱尔斯（塞缪尔•杰克逊Samuel L. Jackson饰）和文森特（约翰•特拉沃尔塔John Travolta饰）在店内用餐，可谓天外有天。二人是否会放过两名小盗贼？\n　　而文森特是黑社会大哥马沙•华莱士（文•瑞姆斯Ving Rhames饰）的手下，马沙下命令让他陪妻子一个晚上，明知如有雷池必死无疑，但面对马沙妻子美艳诱惑，文森特该怎么办。\n　　文森特的故事还没完，拳击手布奇（布鲁斯•威利斯Bruce Willis饰）的出现将令他的人生从此改变。布奇有一块祖传金表，就是因为这块金表，他和马沙分享了一个耻辱的秘密。\n　　故事环状结构，回... (展开全部) ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/18pwrqm6UXBFLPKMO8oXzIw?pwd=nr9v\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-07-19\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":732,"title":"虎口脱险 La grande vadrouille","ratingNum":8.9,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 喜剧片\n好于 98% 战争片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2399597512.webp","tag":"No.225豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 法国 / 英国","years":"1966","date":"1966-12-08(法国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p835625294.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p835631282.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p835632771.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2454191081.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p835631003.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2399597512.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1507541638.webp\"]","descs":"二战期间，英国一架飞机在执行轰炸任务中，被德军击中，几名英国士兵被迫跳伞逃生。他们约好在土耳其浴室见面，并用这次行动的代号“鸳鸯茶”作为接头暗号。\n　　他们分别降落在法国巴黎德军占领区的不同地点。大胡子中队长雷金纳德被动物园管理员所救。而另外两名士兵，也分别在油漆匠奥古斯德 （布尔维尔 饰）和乐队指挥斯塔尼斯拉斯（路易·德·费内斯 饰）的帮助下掩藏好了。即便德军展开了全城的搜索，油漆匠、指挥和中队长还是在浴室顺利地会面，几经辗转，英国士兵终于接上了头。几个原本并不认识的人，就这样结成了生死同盟，与敌人展开了斗智斗勇的生死游戏。同时，也闹出了不少温情的笑话。他们用微薄的力量对抗严酷德军，险相迭生，滑稽搞笑，为了逃出虎口，共同战斗。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1mhc4HKwbyfuHN4NeCGPlxg?pwd=pjss\",\"size\":\"2.85\",\"date\":\"2025-06-17\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":859,"title":"布达佩斯大饭店 The Grand Budapest Hotel","ratingNum":8.9,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 98% 剧情片\n好于 99% 喜剧片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2183539003.webp","tag":"No.80豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 美国 / 德国 / 英国","years":"2014","date":"2014-02-06(柏林电影节)、2014-03-28(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2497604330.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2553388598.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2175449045.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2552426984.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2553388949.webp\",\"